            "id": "ed439998-0e0f-4006-9646-662e7e9565cd",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Awesome....LOVE this. Thank you!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We had an absolutely fantastic stay at this home and it exceeded all expectations. The home was incredibly spacious, spotless, and exceptionally comfortable. With a huge living room and multiple full-suite bedrooms, our three families never once felt crowded, and there was zero stress over who got which room; everyone had their own space to relax and unwind.The game area was a huge hit, especially the pinball machines, and we loved hosting movie nights together after full days at the beach. Having so many inviting gathering spaces made it easy to spend quality time together while still enjoying plenty of room to spread out. The private heated pool was another highlight and the golf cart made getting around a blast!We would stay here again in a heartbeat and highly recommend it to anyone, not to mention the management company was first class in how they communicated and updated us throughout the process. It was refreshing as we've had bad experiences with other owners/management companies.This home was exactly the relaxing, memory-filled getaway we needed! Our only negative is that we could only stay for a short time this trip, but are already planning for a longer trip this Summer!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
